# Heroes' Hangout, Date Night: the top two cards (Mountain, Lightning Bolt) are exiled and Bot1 chooses the Bolt. Only the
# chosen card may be played: the Mountain is refused on turn 3 although Bot1 has its land drop (the positive control is
# the Bolt, cast from exile on turn 3 - "until the end of your next turn", not only this turn - CR 514.2).
[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Heroes' Hangout
Mountain x5
Mountain
Lightning Bolt
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Heroes' Hangout.Cast
Bot1.Modes(1)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Lightning Bolt)
? Exile = Lightning Bolt; Mountain
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
! Bot1.Exile.Mountain.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Activate
Bot1.Exile.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot2)

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 17
Exile = Mountain
Bot1.Graveyard = Lightning Bolt; Heroes' Hangout
